61:Hilltop Estate is located on Tamborine Mountain in the Gold Coast Hinterland, Queensland — and we're technically within the Gold Coast itself. We're only about 25 minutes from the Gold Coast CBD and around 50 minutes from Brisbane, so your guests get a mountain escape without a long drive from the city.
62-
63:Hilltop Estate is a premier wedding venue and restaurant in Mt Tamborine. We offer luxury wedding ceremonies and receptions, fine dining restaurant experiences, corporate events, and private functions, all with stunning views of the Gold Coast Hinterland.
64-
65:Our on-site restaurant is temporarily closed and bookings are currently paused. We'll announce our reopening date here as soon as it's confirmed. In the meantime, Hilltop Estate remains open for weddings and private events.
66-
67:Hilltop Estate combines a 120-year-old Heritage Chapel with modern luxury facilities, offering 360-degree views from sunrise over the Gold Coast beaches to sunset behind the mountain ranges. Our Mt Tamborine location provides a stunning backdrop for unforgettable weddings.
68-
69:Our wedding packages include exclusive venue hire, ceremony and reception spaces, tables, chairs, white linens, coordinated catering with customizable menus through our preferred partners, professional service staff, setup and cleanup, parking facilities, and complimentary Bridal Suite access. We also offer add-on services like floral arrangements, photography, and entertainment coordination.
70-
71-Hilltop Estate caters for weddings and events of up to 70 guests. We offer flexible spaces for intimate ceremonies through to celebrations at full capacity. Get in touch with our team to discuss your vision and we'll tailor the perfect setup for your day. Contact us on 1300 912 765 or via our Contact page.
72-
73:Yes — we coordinate wedding dining through our experienced preferred catering partners, and approved external caterers are also welcome. Choose from formal plated dinners, shared feasts, buffet-style service and cocktail receptions. All menus can be customized to accommodate dietary requirements including vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, and other special needs.
74-
75:Absolutely! Hilltop Estate is designed as a complete wedding venue. You can host your ceremony in our beautiful chapel or garden pavilion, followed by your reception in our elegant reception area. This eliminates the need for guest transportation between venues and allows you to enjoy your entire celebration in one stunning location.
76-
79:Yes! Hilltop Estate offers 5 rooms on-site — the Bridal Suite plus 4 guest rooms — perfect for your wedding party and guests. For larger wedding groups, Mount Tamborine also offers numerous nearby accommodation options ranging from luxury B&Bs to holiday rentals within a 5-10 minute drive of the venue.
80-
81:We have beautiful indoor and covered options to ensure your day proceeds smoothly regardless of weather. Our chapel provides a stunning ceremony space, and our reception area features floor-to-ceiling windows with panoramic views. We always have a wet weather contingency plan in place for every event.
82-
83:Absolutely! We encourage all couples to visit Hilltop Estate before making their decision. You can schedule a private tour with our team by calling 1300 912 765 or book online through our Book a Tour page.
